melody:
# Verse
Ha-ʻa-heo ka u-a i nā pali,
D4/ G4/ B4. A4/ G4/ F#4/ G4/ E4/ D4(2) r
ke nihi a-ʻe-la ka na-hele,
B4 A4. G#4/ A4/ A4/ C5/ B4/ A4(3)
e ha-ha-i a-na i ka liko,
D4/ G4/ B4. A4/ G4/ F#4/ G4/ E4/ D4(2) r
pu-a ʻā-hi-hi le-hu-a o uka.
D4/ D4/ E4 A4/ G4/ F#4/ B4/ A4/ F#4/ G4(2) r/

# Chorus
A-lo-ha ʻo-e, a-lo-ha ʻo-e,
G4/ G4/ F#4/ E4 ~G4 C5/ E4/ E4/ E4/ D4 ~G4 B4
e ke o-na-o-na no-ho i ka li-po.
G4/ G4/ F#4/ F#4/ F#4/ G4/ A4/ G#4/ A4/ C5/ B4(2) G4 r/
One fond em-brace, a ho-ʻi a-ʻe au,
F#4/ E4 G4 C5. E4/ D4/ D4/ G4/ G4/ B4.
un-til we meet a-gain.
G4/ F#4. G4/ B4/ ~A4 F#4/ G4(3) r
